<title>USA: Mediq to post $0.24 Q1 shr gain from sale.</title>
<headline>Mediq to post $0.24 Q1 shr gain from sale.</headline>
<dateline>PENNSAUKEN, N.J. 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mediq Inc said Thursday it expects to post a gain of $6.2 million, or $0.24 per share, in the first quarter of 1997 from the sale of its stake in NutraMax Products Inc.  </p>
<p>Mediq said in a release that as a result of the sale of its 47 percent interest in NutraMax at a price of $9 per share, it received almost $20 million of the $36.3 million purchase price in cash.</p>
<p>Mediq said it received a promissory note for the remaining $16.37 million, adding that proceeds were used to reduce outstanding borrowings under its bank facility.</p>
